For true melee weapons, Mojo comes first, for non-shock resistant
monsters, followed by the Bat.  But the Bat is usually better, because
nothing resists its damage, and it won't destroy your enemies' wands.

If you are riding, nothing beats Reaper, which does slightly more
damage than the Bat.

For extra fun, try double wielding the +7 Bat and +7 Mojo, and you will
average over 70 damage per round.



